{"availability":"available","full":"sumitgoxlofficial-jpg/fitron","name":"fitron","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-27T18:53:43Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:12:36Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fitron-virid.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://fitron-virid.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:10.787Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:10.787Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:05:10.787Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T06:40:07.456Z","stars":0,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:05:10.787Z","stars":0,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One product for India's fitness market, live at fitron.in, in three parts that share one login system and one database:","They work together: a gym on FITRON gives its members the AI Trainer under its own brand, sees their training next to their dues, and earns 70% of members' AI Trainer subscriptions through the Gym Partnership.","The AI Trainer's design is the browser demo in prototype/ai-trainer/ (serve the folder and open index.html). The app serves it, wired to the real backend, at /trainer from public/trainer/; the demo's unreachable admin console, landing page and preview controls are not in that copy."],"features":["Website (fitron.in): the landing page with pricing, free-trial sign-up, contact form and policies.","FITRON AI Trainer: an AI personal trainer for members, from ₹299 a month. Personalised workout plans, Indian meal plans by city, diet and budget, a 24/7 AI coach, habits, progress and weekly reviews.","FITRON Gym Accounting: gym management and GST accounting for gym owners, from ₹999 a month. Members, plans and renewals, GST invoices, payments, expenses and P&L, assets, purchases, POS, classes, leads, attendance,…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sumitgoxlofficial-jpg/fitron/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f1ce80f61fb71b89c114